%% Demo for Fix #83: an alt whose else branch holds only a return keeps both branches; nothing after `end` belongs to the group.
%% Import it into a draft of sase-hld (or a blank design) with "Import Mermaid...": all three participants are components.
sequenceDiagram
    title Do work with a denied branch
    A->>B: do work
    alt ok
        B->>A: GET /x
        A-->>B: x-data
    else fail
        B-->>A: 403 denied
    end
    A-)B: notify later
    A->>U: after async
    Note over A,B: runs after the group
    B-->>A: work done
